      "en": "Then he measured the wall of the house, six cubits; and the width of every side room, four cubits, all around the house on every side.",
      "ko": "전의 벽을 척량하니 두께가 육척이며 전 삼면에 골방이 있는데 광이 각기 사척이며",
      "source_text_hash": "8324f97ba7c5a47f16efd6e005b3baaee5fe043284466ab4dabeff29eece4292",
      "translation_text_hash": "ea01dccd28ec863cc60fdcf0ca8639bc7b3a1cc17956fae66d328cd549fd5c83",
