          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 41,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "The side rooms were in three stories, one over another, and thirty in each story. They entered into the wall which belonged to the house for the side rooms all around, that they might be supported and not penetrate the wall of the house.",
      "ko": "골방은 삼층인데 골방 위에 골방이 있어 모두 삼십이라 그 삼면 골방이 전 벽 밖으로 그 벽에 의지하였고 전 벽 속은 범하지 아니하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "9297e8aa48d986861c19463ee6d7c320a99b91823d6835fdfb4bfbf9de7c27b3",
      "translation_text_hash": "57fd84093e73884d1f183a5bcf89bd635b48eb3ee13ffcf7a46df0295fc2b728",
